@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
title Structure Padding Example

class "struct A" as SA {
  + char c
  + int  i
}

note right of SA
Expected = 1 + 4 = 5 bytes
Actual   = 8 bytes (padding added)
end note

note bottom
Typical layout:
| c | pad pad pad | i i i i |
end note
@enduml
